//     server PACKETVER: 20190605, pre-renewal (RENEWAL disabled)
//     6169 items (2039 equipment, 1034 with unconditional flat bonuses).
//
// Weight is rAthena's 0.1 unit divided by 10, i.e. the whole client weight
// unit the server uses for its own display and calculations.
//
// The file is loaded at runtime through the normal client file loader
// (`data\client\item_stats.ron`), so a server can override the table without
// rebuilding the client. The compiled copy below is the fallback.
//
// `items` is a strictly ascending list of `(item id, stats)`. Fields equal to
// their default are omitted; `weight` is always present. Only unconditional
// flat bonuses are listed (conditional/percentage bonuses are evaluated by the
// server and are not part of the client stat panel data).
